DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
3479::$$$message_0025_0000_0000$$$::Everyone's having tea in the living room shortly before lunch.[lr]::
3480::$$$message_0025_0000_0001$$$::Suddenly, while we're watching TV...[lr]::
3481::$$$message_0025_0000_0002$$$::"Marriage, huh? Sounds nice..."[lr]::
3482::$$$message_0025_0000_0003$$$::I hear those words.::
3483::$$$message_0025_0001_0000$$$::There's an indescribable tension in the air.[lr]::
3484::$$$message_0025_0001_0001$$$::...Everyone's probably thinking the same thing.[lr]::
3485::$$$message_0025_0001_0002$$$::"What? Taiga, you want to get married?"[lr]::
3486::$$$message_0025_0001_0003$$$::Illya sets her mug of milk tea down with a thud, speaking for everyone.::
3487::$$$message_0025_0002_0000$$$::Sakura speaks up next.[lr]::
3488::$$$message_0025_0002_0001$$$::"...It really is quietest right before a bomb goes off."::
3489::$$$message_0025_0003_0000$$$::"I'll let you use my castle for your wedding ceremony, if you want. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ02b(中)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ02b(中) textoff=0]Assuming you have someone to marry, of course."::
3490::$$$message_0025_0004_0000$$$::Then, Tohsaka.[lr]::
3491::$$$message_0025_0004_0001$$$::"...Now it's going to explode."::
3492::$$$message_0025_0005_0000$$$::"There's no way I have someone like that![lr]::
3493::$$$message_0025_0005_0001$$$::At first I thought I'd stick around until Shirou can get by on his own, [wvl][se storage=se251.wav]but then two, three more people moved in, and now this girls' school fad has completely taken over my dream of turning Kiritsugu's house into a hot springs inn[line len=2]I swear, it's just a fad[line len=2]oh my god I don't even have time to take my eyes off this den of vice, you know!"::
3494::$$$message_0025_0006_0000$$$::"Taiga! Calm down!"[lr]::
3495::$$$message_0025_0006_0001$$$::"W-w-what am I supposed to do now!?[lr]::
3496::$$$message_0025_0006_0002$$$::Now I tell myself that I need to keep a strict eye on Shirou as both a teacher and a sister so he doesn't go down the wrong path, but it's getting to be such a pain that I'm considering getting my tubes tied, so to speak, [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01c(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=セイバー私服01c(中) time=300 textoff=0]and did you know that our country's considering reviving the traditional art of burying the first one or two children in times of austerity[line len=2]"::
3497::$$$message_0025_0007_0000$$$::"... Saber, it's ok, go ahead."[lr]::
3498::$$$message_0025_0007_0001$$$::"Hmm? Actually, that sounds kinda interesting now that I mention it! [cacheimage storage=藤fd特殊02c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤fd特殊02c(中)]All right, let's try it! It's best to try things out once before you think about it too much! It's easy!"::
3499::$$$message_0025_0008_0000$$$::It looks like Saber only lightly tapped her, but Fuji-nee slumps over.[lr]::
3500::$$$message_0025_0008_0001$$$::...I feel bad for her, but this was the quickest and most appropriate solution.::
3501::$$$message_0025_0009_0000$$$::"Taiga is asleep. I'm sorry, Shirou. I used forceful measures in the heat of the moment."[lr]::
3502::$$$message_0025_0009_0001$$$::Saber apologizes to me after carrying Fuji-nee off to her room.::
3503::$$$message_0025_0010_0000$$$::"You didn't do anything to apologize for. [cacheimage storage=凛私服02a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服02a(中) textoff=0]Who knows what tragedy might've unfolded if we let her be?"[lr]::
3504::$$$message_0025_0010_0001$$$::Tohsaka gave the order, to begin with.::
3505::$$$message_0025_0011_0000$$$::"What? Are you saying we should've let Ms. Fujimura run amok?"[lr]::
3506::$$$message_0025_0011_0001$$$::"...No, I'm not criticizing anyone.[lr]::
3507::$$$message_0025_0011_0002$$$::If Saber hadn't stepped in, I might've needed to risk my life to stop her."[lr]::
3508::$$$message_0025_0011_0003$$$::Looking at it that way, we got off with the bare minimum of casualties.::
3509::$$$message_0025_0012_0000$$$::"Taiga's so hopeless. She should be more self-centered if she wants to get married.[lr]::
3510::$$$message_0025_0012_0001$$$::She really is a teacher to the core, always worrying about other people."[lr]::
3511::$$$message_0025_0012_0002$$$::Illya sighs in exasperation as she brews more tea.::
3512::$$$message_0025_0013_0000$$$::"Emiya, why don't you marry Ms. Fujimura?"[lr]::
3513::$$$message_0025_0013_0001$$$::"No!"[lr]::
3514::$$$message_0025_0013_0002$$$::An instantaneous answer.[lr]::
3515::$$$message_0025_0013_0003$$$::Sakura blurted it out on reflex before Tohsaka was even done talking.::
3516::$$$message_0025_0014_0000$$$::"I'm kidding. Come on, you even made him freeze up."[lr]::
3517::$$$message_0025_0014_0001$$$::"Ah, Senpai. [cacheimage storage=桜私服12d頬(遠)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=200 storage=桜私服12d頬(遠) textoff=0]I didn't really mean it like that."[lr]::
3518::$$$message_0025_0014_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服04e(中),凛私服03b(中) textoff=0]Then what [font italic=true]did[font italic=false] you mean by it? I have a feeling I shouldn't ask.::
3519::$$$message_0025_0015_0000$$$::"Hahaha... Still though, it feels weird to hear her bring up marriage suddenly."[lr]::
3520::$$$message_0025_0015_0001$$$::"That's just normal. It just isn't something the rest of us really need to worry about."[lr]::
3521::$$$message_0025_0015_0002$$$::It's true that everyone else here isn't living a lifestyle that could lead to a traditional married household anytime soon.::
3522::$$$message_0025_0016_0000$$$::...Sakura and I make eye contact.[lr]::
3523::$$$message_0025_0016_0001$$$::Tohsaka notices and smirks at me unsettlingly from an angle that only I can see.::
3524::$$$message_0025_0017_0000$$$::"What are you talking about, Rin? You had a priest as your legal guardian."[lr]::
3525::$$$message_0025_0017_0001$$$::"But I didn't live at the church, and I wasn't that close to him, either."::
3526::$$$message_0025_0018_0000$$$::...That's true.[lr]::
3527::$$$message_0025_0018_0001$$$::I've never seen one myself, but people do hold wedding ceremonies at the Fuyuki church.::
3528::$$$message_0025_0019_0000$$$::"...Wait, so that guy's been blessing people's marriages?"[lr]::
3529::$$$message_0025_0019_0001$$$::Uh...I'm not sure if that would be a wedding or a divine tribunal...::
3530::$$$message_0025_0020_0000$$$::"Sure he did.[lr]::
3531::$$$message_0025_0020_0001$$$::...He never missed a beat as a priest, at least. I'm sure that the couples he officiated were happy with his services."::
3532::$$$message_0025_0021_0000$$$::...Right.[lr]::
3533::$$$message_0025_0021_0001$$$::He was a perfect priest, despite his personality. That's what was so terrifying about him.[lr]::
3534::$$$message_0025_0021_0002$$$::...The people closest to marriage that I know of would be Mr. Kuzuki and Caster... Do they count?::
3535::$$$message_0025_0022_0000$$$::"If I may,[lr]::
3536::$$$message_0025_0022_0001$$$::I do have experience with weddings. I did have a ceremony, it was at my castle."[lr]::
3537::$$$message_0025_0022_0002$$$::"Eh...?"[lr]::
3538::$$$message_0025_0022_0003$$$::My jaw drops, along with Sakura and Tohsaka.::
3539::$$$message_0025_0023_0000$$$::"What are you all so surprised for? Of course Saber's been married."[lr]::
3540::$$$message_0025_0023_0001$$$::"That's right, now that you mention it."[lr]::
3541::$$$message_0025_0023_0002$$$::...Oh.[lr]::
3542::$$$message_0025_0023_0003$$$::There's a lot about Saber's legend that I'm unsure of the veracity of, but it's widely written that King Arthur was married.[lr]::
3543::$$$message_0025_0023_0004$$$::But given how that marriage ended, it didn't feel like a subject I could broach out of casual curiosity.::
3544::$$$message_0025_0024_0000$$$::I meet Tohsaka and Sakura's eyes. They must have been thinking the same thing.::
3545::$$$message_0025_0025_0000$$$::"So, what was married life like?"[cacheimage storage=桜私服08g(遠)][wvs][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服08g(遠) textoff=0]::
3546::$$$message_0025_0026_0000$$$::"I don't think you'll find it a very useful reference, Illyasviel. Would you still like to hear about it anyway?"[lr]::
3547::$$$message_0025_0026_0001$$$::"Yeah. That doesn't really matter to me."[lr]::
3548::$$$message_0025_0026_0002$$$::"I see."[lr]::
3549::$$$message_0025_0026_0003$$$::It's a good thing that Fuji-nee isn't around now.::
3550::$$$message_0025_0027_0000$$$::"The ceremony itself was extravagant. It was meant to unite the kingdom, and the feast went on for seven days.[lr]::
3551::$$$message_0025_0027_0001$$$::You could say that our marriage[line len=2]me and Guinevere, that is[line len=2]was celebrated throughout the kingdom. Even if it was just an act, I swore to love her as a man.[lr]::
3552::$$$message_0025_0027_0002$$$::That being said, I was her king more than I was her husband.[lr]::
3553::$$$message_0025_0027_0003$$$::I married her as the king, to put it in harsher terms."::
3554::$$$message_0025_0028_0000$$$::"...Then you married someone you didn't actually love?"::
3555::$$$message_0025_0029_0000$$$::"...Yes. I liked her as a person, but that wasn't enough to be her husband.[lr]::
3556::$$$message_0025_0029_0001$$$::We betrayed each other as a result of that. There is no doubt that I bear some responsibility for the misfortune and disgrace that befell her."::
3557::$$$message_0025_0030_0000$$$::"Still... I did what I could as a man to love her.[lr]::
3558::$$$message_0025_0030_0001$$$::It was a purely political marriage, but I sincerely wished for her happiness at the ceremony. For me, as a human, it was a happy time."::
3559::$$$message_0025_0031_0000$$$::...Saber's voice is so calm, I can't tell what emotions it hides.[lr]::
3560::$$$message_0025_0031_0001$$$::She finishes the story with a slightly forlorn smile.::
903489::$$$message_9025_0003_0000$$$::"I'll let you use my castle for your wedding ceremony, if you want. Assuming you have someone to marry, of course."[r]::
